<title>UK: Household Bank sets 10 bln yen four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Household Bank sets 10 bln yen four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Bank and Wake International (Europe).</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD BANK (NEVADA) NA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  HOUSEHOLD FINANCE CORP (RATED A2/A)</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    20.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.275   PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC   7.5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 100	 GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
